{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf55 <strong>PIZZA EMPIRE \u2014 From Pizzaiolo to Emperor</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It all starts with dough, tomato sauce, and a lot of ambition. One click. One pizza. One empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're nothing more than an apprentice pizza maker in a kitchen too small. But every pizza sold, every euro reinvested, every upgrade unlocked brings you closer to the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, you'll control the pizzerias of the entire world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd25 FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddb1\ufe0f Click to make pizzas \u2014 simple, satisfying, addictive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 Automatic ovens, \ud83d\udef5 delivery drivers, \ud83c\udf55 restaurants, \ud83c\udfed factories, \ud83c\udf0d worldwide franchises</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf55 Evolving recipes \u2014 start with a cheese pizza, end with the ultimate Supreme</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50 Prestige System \u2014 reset everything for a permanent bonus and come back stronger</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8e Ascension \u2014 collect 10 stars to transcend: Ruby bonus, then Diamond, stackable infinitely</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1f Golden Pizza \u2014 a secret pizza appears sometimes\u2026 click fast!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udce6 Pizza Box \u2014 free Steam items to collect while playing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcca Real-time statistics: pizzas/second, total clicks, playtime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 Steam Achievements \u2014 prove you're a true Emperor</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3248550/extras/8a73c32c766d